This is the first version of the Repentance DLC.

= Additions =
For a description of the new content added to the game, see the [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]] page.

= Documented Changes =

== Characters ==
* 1 - {{c|Magdalene}} - The unlockable starting [[pill]] is changed to Full Health (from Speed Up). Full Health is guaranteed to be in the run's pill rotation.
* 1 - {{c|Magdalene}} - Health Up is guaranteed to be in the run's pill rotation.
* 9 - {{c|Eden}} - Fixed a rare crash caused when {{c|Eden}} starts with {{t|Error}}.
* 9 - {{c|Eden}} - Fixed {{t|Mom's Toenail}} immediately stomping when {{c|Eden}} starts with it.
* 9 - {{c|Eden}} - Starting [[tear delay]] can't get quite as bad as before (roughly ~15 tear delay maximum).
* 10 - {{c|The Lost}} - The starting {{i|Holy Mantle}} is now an effect intrinsic to him once unlocked, and cannot be rerolled.
* 10 - {{c|The Lost}} - The starting [[active item]] has changed from the {{i|D4}} to the {{i|Eternal D6}}.
* 10 - {{c|The Lost}} - Can only take one item per [[Devil Room#Deals with the Devil|devil deal]]. Other options, if present, will disappear.
* 12 - {{c|Black Judas}} - Now shares the same health properties as {{c|???}}. [[Heart container]]s cannot be gained, and will instead be converted to [[Black Heart]]s.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Can now have up to three [[Health#Coin Hearts|coin containers]]. If the "Keeper now holds a penny" achievement has been unlocked, he will start with three.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Starting [[speed]] has been increased to 0.9 (from 0.85).
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Starting tear delay has been reduced to 27.4 (from 28).
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Is now unable to lose devil/angel deal chances through taking damage.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Is now unable to get Health Down pills.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Devil deals now sell items for money.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - Hematemesis now spawns [[coins]].
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - {{i|Abaddon}} no longer kills {{c|Keeper}} when picked up, but reduces the amount of coin containers to one.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - {{i|Midas' Touch}} can now appear when playing as {{c|Keeper}} (previously it could not appear).
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - {{t|Swallowed Penny}} now works similarly to {{i|Piggy Bank}} in that it no longer guarantees a coin drop with every hit.
* 14 - {{c|Keeper}} - [[Blood donation machine]]s are no longer guaranteed to payout.
* 16 - {{c|The Forgotten}} - Fixed the bug where using a [[bed]] would give soul hearts to [[The Soul]].
* 16 - {{c|The Forgotten}} - Fixed full heals not affecting the body when obtained as {{c|The Soul}}.
* 16 - {{c|The Forgotten}} - Fixed being damaged by lasers generated from the {{i|Haemolacria}} + {{i|Jacob's Ladder}} synergy.

== Items (General) ==
* Timed recharge items now recharge immediately upon room clear, and from certain item effects (such as {{i|Habit}} or {{i|Charged Baby}}).
* The use animation on most active items has been shortened, allowing players to attack again more quickly than before.
* Updated the [[transformation]] lists to include more previously uncounted items.
* Updated the descriptions of various items to be more accurate/informative.
* Added an aim direction buffer to assist with firing charged attacks diagonally, such as {{i|Mom's Knife}}.
* Added tons of new synergies between existing items.
* Removed the "[[special item]]" system.
* Most HP upgrades now heal more on pickup than previously.
* The rotation speed of most [[Familiar#Orbital Familiars|orbitals]] (aside from {{i|Big Fan}} and attack flies) decreased from 4.05 degrees per frame to 2.7 degrees pre frame.

== Items (Familiars) ==
* Added a [[familiar]] chain priority system. {{i|Incubus}} will always be closest to the player, {{i|Lil Brimstone}} second. The rest of the shooting familiars have equal priority, with non-damaging familiars last.
* Fixed a few pathfinding issues with some familiars (especially {{i|Bumbo}}).
* Fixed charged familiars releasing their attack when the player gets hit or picks up an item.
* Fixed several instances of familiars disappearing, only to respawn later once the player gets another familiar.
* Fixed an issue that caused many familiars' tears to be {{i|Soy Milk}} sized.
* Basic shooting familiars now fire at an increased rate, to match their rate of fire in Wrath of the Lamb (every 22 frames, down from every 30 frames).
* Familiars that mimic Isaac's movement (such as {{i|Shade}}, {{i|Papa Fly}}, or {{i|Obsessed Fan}}) now follow Isaac more closely (roughly a 0.66s delay, down from 2s).

