* 437 - {{i|D7}} - Fixed not rerolling miniboss drops.
* 437 - {{i|D7}} - Fixed not properly refreshing [[Greed]] miniboss rooms.
* 440 - {{i|Kidney Stone}} - No longer has a speed downgrade.
* 441 - {{i|Mega Blast}} - Fixed the laser not being the correct color when combined with certain tear effects.
* 442 - {{i|Dark Prince's Crown}} - Reduced the price in devil deals to one heart.
* 442 - {{i|Dark Prince's Crown}} - Now grants more of an increase in the rate of fire, and the bonus now breaks the soft tears cap.
* 444 - {{i|Lead Pencil}} - The tear barrage no longer deals double damage.
* 448 - {{i|Shard of Glass}} now causes Isaac to start bleeding upon taking damage, slowly draining his red health over time. While bleeding, he leaves a trail of creep and spews a fountain of controllable blood shots. The effect ends when Isaac receives any kind of red heart healing, or when he runs out of red health to use (it cannot kill him).
* 451 - {{i|Tarot Cloth}} - Added a slow pulsing outline HUD effect for cards that would be buffed.
* 451 - {{i|Tarot Cloth}} - Now only buffs tarot cards. Some cards that previously did not benefit from doubling now have unique effects.
* 456 - {{i|Midnight Snack}} - Renamed from Moldy Bread. Pickup quote changed to "HP up".
* 462 - {{i|Eye of Belial}} - Fixed tear impacts being the default tear color.
* 464 - {{i|Glyph of Balance}} - Now also modifies room clear rewards.
* 470 - {{i|Hushy}} - Damage tick rate has been decreased.
* 472 - {{i|King Baby}} - Familiars being commanded by King Baby now automatically aim at enemies.
* 473 - {{i|Big Chubby}} - Fixed it being unable to destroy fireplaces.
* 473 - {{i|Big Chubby}} - The damage tick rates have been increased.
* 477 - {{i|Void}} - Can now suck up items that are held over Isaac's head. This allows usage on purchased shop/devil items.
* 477 - {{i|Void}} - No longer activates effects immediately upon sucking them up. This allows for more strategic activation timing for single-use actives.
* 482 - {{i|Clicker}} - Fixed being able to remove key items, such as The Polaroid/Negative or key pieces.
* 483 - {{i|Mama Mega!}} - The effect now blows up machines, beggars, and fireplaces.
* 483 - {{i|Mama Mega!}} - Added new visual and sound effects for the explosion.
* 487 - {{i|Potato Peeler}} - Added extra visual feedback for the effect.
* 489 - {{i|D infinity}} - Has been reworked. Press the drop button to cycle through to the next dice (there is no limit to this). Charge time scales based on the chosen dice, updating with each usage. No longer forces the player to use a different effect.
* 491 - {{i|Acid Baby}} - The pill drop rate has been reduced to every 6-7 rooms (previously every 2-3 rooms). Upon using a pill, all enemies in the room now take 10 damage and become poisoned for 6-7 ticks (previously only had the poison effect for 2 ticks).
* 492 - {{i|YO LISTEN!}} - Fixed hovering over obstacles that are ineligible for a crawlspace.
* 493 - {{i|Adrenaline}} - Fixed the item causing some item costumes to be improperly scaled.
* 493 - {{i|Adrenaline}} - Now grants an increasingly higher damage bonus the more empty heart containers Isaac has.
* 494 - {{i|Jacob's Ladder}} - Electricity arcs now have a maximum range unless chained through enemies. They also cannot deal extra damage to the enemy being hit by the tear.
* 495 - {{i|Ghost Pepper}} - Now shoots spectral blue flames that scale with Isaac's damage and luck.
* 497 - {{i|Camo Undies}} - Fixed some broken interactions with items that change Isaac's color.
* 501 - {{i|Greed's Gullet}} - Fixed not applying its bonus retroactively.
* 503 - {{i|Little Horn}} - Fixed an issue where the contact damage effect would override superior contact damage effects from other items.
* 503 - {{i|Little Horn}} - The tear effect isn't piercing anymore, but can now summon Big Horn's hand to slap bosses for extra damage. Still is an instant kill on regular enemies, and features a new animation of Big Horn's hand grabbing them.
* 504 - {{i|Brown Nugget}} - Fixed Brown Nugget flies not being buffed by Hive Mind/BFFs.
* 504 - {{i|Brown Nugget}} - Brown Nugget flies now have faster-shot speed, and their damage has been increased to 3.5 (from 2).
* 507 - {{i|Sharp Straw}} - Added extra visual feedback for the effect.
* 507 - {{i|Sharp Straw}} - Now only able to generate half red hearts (previously, it generated half soul hearts if the player had no heart containers).
* 507 - {{i|Sharp Straw}} - Now mostly ignores the +40 damage from Ipecac in its damage formula.
* 509 - {{i|Bloodshot Eye}} - Now blocks enemy shots, has increased shot speed and rate of fire, and now only shoots when lined up with enemies.
* 513 - {{i|Bozo}} - Fixed failing to create poop ontop of various objects (such as already destroyed poop piles).
* 517 - {{i|Fast Bombs}} - Bombs no longer knock each other around when the player has Fast Bombs, allowing for a more controlled line of explosions.
* 519 - {{i|Lil Delirium}} - Updated the colors of the attacks.
* 520 - {{i|Jumper Cables}} - No longer plays the "item ready" sound effect when only granting partial charge.
* 522 - {{i|Telekinesis}} - Added a new visual effect.
* 522 - {{i|Telekinesis}} - Has more downtime between being able to activate it again, and now repels nearby enemies. Enemy shots picked up now retain their properties (such as appearance, or the ability for Ipecac shots to explode).
* 523 - {{i|Moving Box}} - Now has a cap of 6 held items/pickups (previously unlimited). Packing up chests/items from [[Challenge Room]]s or the [[Boss Rush]] now starts the ambush.
* 524 - {{i|Technology Zero}} - The lasers now deal 30% of the player's damage stat per tick (from 100%).
* 527 - {{i|Mr. ME!}} - No longer restocks shops when stealing from them.
* 530 - {{i|Death's List}} - Fixed a softlock caused by triggering the thumbs up animation while falling down a [[Pitfall]].
* 534 - {{i|Schoolbag}} - Displays the secondary active item to the top left of the primary active, instead of being in the bottom right of it. It also no longer displays a HUD icon when empty.
* 534 - {{i|Schoolbag}} - Fixed most known bugs (items deactivating when swapping, certain passive effects not working correctly, etc).
* 535 - {{i|Blanket}} - Added visual and sound effects for losing the shield.
* 535 - {{i|Blanket}} - The shield now has significantly fewer invulnerability frames when lost.
* 543 - {{i|Hallowed Ground}} - White poop is now more durable, similar to golden poop. While standing in the aura, Isaac's damage is now also increased by 25%, and his tears gain a homing effect.
* 545 - {{i|Book of the Dead}} - Charge time has been increased to 6 (from 4). Generated orbitals now break more easily.
* 548 - {{i|Jaw Bone}} - Fixed a bugged interaction with sticky nickels.

== Trinkets (General) ==
* It is now possible to pick up two of the same trinket (if it was duplicated). Effects can stack.
* Reworked smelted trinkets to have a more consistent implementation (they are now shared between coop babies and can be removed or rerolled by items such as the {{i|D4}} and {{i|Clicker}}).
* Updated some trinkets to support doubled effects from {{i|Mom's Box}} and golden trinkets.

== Trinkets (Specific) ==
* 10 - {{t|Wiggle Worm}} - Now grants spectral tears.
* 11 - {{t|Ring Worm}} - Now grants spectral tears.
* 13 - {{t|Store Credit}} - Fixed allowing for infinite trinket purchases in [[Greed Mode]].
* 15 - {{t|Lucky Rock}} - Now has a 33% chance to drop a coin for every rock destroyed (previously 100%).
* 26 - {{t|Hook Worm}} - Now grants spectral tears.
* 32 - {{t|Liberty Cap}} - Updated the list of possible effects.
* 32 - {{t|Liberty Cap}} - Fixed giving the Compass effect instead of Magic Mushroom.
* 33 - {{t|Umbilical Cord}} - Now has a high chance to spawn a {{i|Gemini}} familiar for the room when Isaac takes damage. This effect is stackable.
* 40 - {{t|Red Patch}} - Fixed not applying its costume when the effect activates.
* 46 - {{t|Isaac's Fork}} - Fixed not having any indicators of the effect activating.
* 49 - {{t|Bloody Penny}} - Now has a 25% chance to drop extra pickups (previously 50%).
* 50 - {{t|Burnt Penny}} - Now has a 25% chance to drop extra pickups (previously 50%).
* 51 - {{t|Flat Penny}} - Now has a 25% chance to drop extra pickups (previously 50%).
* 57 - {{t|???'s Soul}} - Fixed the familiar leaving the room bounds in L rooms.
* 61 - {{t|The Left Hand}} - No longer change already existing chests.
* 69 - {{t|Faded Polaroid}} - Fixed some broken interactions with items that change Isaac's color.
* 92 - {{t|Cracked Crown}} - Reduced the stat bonuses to +20% (from +33%) and removed the flat independent tears upgrade from it.
* 94 - {{t|Fish Tail}} - Fixed not working with several blue fly sources.
* 97 - {{t|Tonsil}} - The familiar is no longer considered a collectible item, meaning Eden cannot start with it and it doesn't appear on the collection page.
* 109 - {{t|Duct Tape}} - Fixed not setting the position of familiars correctly at the start of a room when obtained by the {{t|Error}} trinket.
* 119 - {{t|Stem Cell}} - Now heals Isaac's heart containers to 50% each floor. If Isaac already has 50% health or more, it does the previous effect of healing half of a heart.
* 128 - {{t|Finger Bone}} - The chance to grant a bone heart has been increased to 5% per hit taken (from 2%).

== Pills ==
* The pixelation visual effect (used by Retro Vision and stage transitions) has been reworked and is generally less blurry/painful to look at.
* Retro Vision now lasts a set amount of time instead of going away and returning at random intervals.
* Restored the original description for the "I Found Pills" pill effect.
* Fixed I Can See Forever not always opening secret rooms in [[The Void]].
* Pill rotation generation has been reworked to reduce the amount of "joke" pills in rotation and to increase the prevalence of stat modifiers.
* Bombs are Key pill now swaps golden keys/bombs. A carried golden key would change into a golden bomb, and vise versa.
* I'm Drowsy and I'm Excited pills now also affect the speed of the players and their attacks.

== Cards & Runes ==
* Added "rune shards", which are weaker versions of existing runes. They only appear if not all runes have been unlocked.
* Added a unique card back for Ancient Recall.
* Added visual and sound effects for losing a Holy Card shield.
* Fixed Hagalaz being able to open secret rooms in L rooms.
* Fixed Blank Rune not being able to trigger Black Rune.
* Holy Card's shield now persists between rooms/floors.
* "Ace" cards now convert all non-boss enemies in the room into the respective pickups. Still applies to other pickups in the room as well.
* The effect of the Devil card is now stackable.
* Black Rune can now suck up items that are held over Isaac's head. This allows usage on purchased shop/devil items.
* Holy Card shields now have significantly fewer invulnerability frames when lost.
* Reduced the shield duration of the Algiz rune to 20 seconds (from 30 seconds).

== Other Pickups ==
* Black hearts no longer pause the game with animation when lost. New, less intrusive effects have been added for them.
* Items/mechanics that damage red hearts first now ignore eternal hearts instead of removing them.
* Bombs now flash corresponding to their detonation timer, instead of exploding without warning.
* Many minor tweaks and improvements to various pickup animations.
* Mimic chests have been updated to be more subtle in their appearance.
* Lucky pennies now use translation strings and show their name when picked up, with "Luck up" being the description.
* Added a unique bomb appearance for golden bombs.
* Added animation for using golden keys on key blocks (previously it just reused the normal key animation).
* Fixed nickels and dimes not having the sparkling pickup animation like regular pennies.
* Fixed a glitch causing Gold Hearts to instantly break when picked up if a Gold Heart had been previously picked up and lost.
* Fixed brown and spiked chests opened in Chapter 6 turning into golden chests when an item appears from them.
* Fixed gold and red chests losing their outline when an item appears from them.
* Fixed spiked chests being able to spawn in narrow pathways.
* Batteries can no longer appear as room clear rewards without certain trinkets.
* Eternal chests are now guaranteed to pay out at least once.

== Machines & Beggars ==
* [[Mom's Dressing Table]] has been moved from the starting room to bedrooms.
* Beggars and machines no longer drop item pedestals when bombed in The Chest/Dark Room.
* Demon beggars now always drop hostile spiders when bombed.
* Bomb bums now retaliate when bombed.
* Fixed being able to pay demon beggars twice per half heart.
* Bomb Bum's payouts have changed to give coins and hearts back instead of more bombs.
* Restock machines now explode when bombed. Still grants one reroll/restock in the process. They also appear much less frequently outside of Greed Mode.

== Enemies ==
* Enemies now die upon reaching zero health. Previously, enemies needed to reach negative health to die. This mostly improves the lethality of items that deal fixed damage.
* [[Portal]]s now only appear in [[The Void]].
* Slightly tweaked enemies with [[Larry Jr.]] style behavior to have smoother movement.
* [[Chubber]]'s chomping maggot projectile now dies when the Chubber does, instead of returning to the original firing position and disappearing.
* [[Ulcer]]s now fire blood shots in arcs instead of in straight lines.
* Flames spawned by certain enemies now play a sound and animation when extinguished.
* Fires left behind by enemies can now be extinguished by player attacks, and are more visually distinct.
* Certain enemy replacements no longer happen on inappropriate floors (no Mushrooms in Womb, no Blisters in Basement, etc).
* Fireplaces, movable TNT barrels, and all invincible stone type enemies (i.e. [[Stone Grimace]]s, [[Stoney|Stonies]]) now follow obstacle rules when colliding with tears (piercing shots are blocked, spectral shots pass through).
* Added visual telegraph for when [[Eye]] enemies are about to attack.
* Added visual telegraph for red/purple fireplace attacks.
* Added a visual and sound telegraph for Lil Haunt attacks.
* Fixed [[Leech (Enemy)|Leeches]] not pathfinding correctly in rooms with pits.
* Fixed [[Leech (Enemy)|Leeches]] not being properly locked along their charging axis (they no longer wildly bounce from tear knockback).
* Fixed a rare crash caused by [[Soul Sucker]]s.
* Fixed a bug with eternal flies which could cause their position to become undefined when turning into a normal fly.
* Fixed a lot of enemies not being able to become champions when they should.
* Fixed [[The Duke of Flies]], [[The Husk]], and [[The Wretched]] not spawning enemies upon death.
* Fixed [[Guts]] and [[Wall Hugger]]s starting in an unpredictable direction when spawned next to a fireplace.
* Fixed [[Charger]]s getting stuck on other enemies.
* Fixed [[Gurdy]]'s hit sphere not matching the sprite.
* Fixed several enemies not applying their damage resistances when frozen.
* Fixed [[Host]]s being unable to see players from behind spikes, and refusing to pop up if stuck between spikes.
* Fixed being able to trick [[Round Worm]]s into not firing by hugging the nearest rock.
* Fixed slowed enemy projectiles losing their color.
* Fixed [[Carrion Queen]] and [[Mask of Infamy]] disappearing on death with no sound or effect.
* Fixed issues where some enemies could attack without playing an attack animation.
* Fixed [[Buttlicker]]s not being counted for any "on kill" effects (such as {{i|Lusty Blood}}).
* Fixed uncleared rooms not saving champions when leaving and re-entering them.
* Fixed certain enemies being able to deal contact damage to Isaac by jumping onto him while he's flying over pits, snapping back to the ground afterward in a very glitchy looking way.
* Fixed enemies spawning onto and detonating dangerous objects in [[Greed Mode]] (such as TNT).
* Enemies that spawn other enemies upon death will now spawn less of them with each death if they're regenerating dark red champions.
* Yellow champions will no longer spawn on the first chapter.
* Adjusted collision sizes for some entities, such as Peep/Bloat's eyes.
* [[Poison Mind]]s now float over obstacles, and explode on death.
* [[Drowned Charger]]s spawned from [[Drowned Hive]]s now have reduced health.
* [[Fistuloid]]s now have a death animation, which delays and telegraphs their attack.
* Reduced the health of [[Wizoob]]s and [[Red Ghost]]s to 20 base HP and 4 stage HP (from 25 base HP and 5 stage HP).
* Piercing shots no longer damage segmented enemies (such as [[Larry Jr.]]) multiple times per attack.

== Charmed Enemies ==
* Updated some perma-charmed enemies to be less annoying with their attacks and sounds in cleared rooms.
* Fixed some player homing attacks targeting perma-charmed enemies.
* Homing shots from perma-charmed enemies will no longer target Isaac.
* Fixed perma-charmed enemies not blocking shots from other enemies.
* Fixed [[Mr. Maw]]s having extremely erratic and glitchy behavior when charmed.
* Charmed enemies now inflict more damage to other enemies, and receive less contact damage.

== Bosses ==
* [[Mom's Heart]] / [[It Lives!]] now has a small delay before spawning the two Eye enemies at the start of the fight.
* Fixed [[Pin]] and other related bosses being able to deal contact damage during the same frame they were spawned in.
* Fixed some bosses being able to spawn multiple enemies at the exact same location (such as [[Isaac (Boss)|Isaac]] and [[Dingle]]).
* Fixed an issue that caused boss pools to heavily skew towards certain bosses.
* Fixed [[Mom]] rarely ever doing her hand attack when standing near her doors.
* Fixed the [[Chub]] spawned after the [[Matriarch]] fight rarely being pushed in strange ways by the [[Fistuloid]]s orbiting her.
* Fixed the various Blastocyst forms not having an appear animation.
* Fixed [[Mom's Heart]] / [[It Lives!]] being able to spawn enemies in the top center part of the room, usually causing them to die instantly from the projectiles fired by the heart.
* Fixed a bug that caused [[Conquest]] to share his health with [[War]] or other Conquests in the room.
* Fixed a bug with [[Mega Satan]] where bombs would go into a bugged state and be deleted without exploding during his transition to phase 2.
* Fixed [[Hush]] being able to immediately cause contact damage during its appearance animation.
* Fixed [[Turdlings]] not being healed by {{i|Butt Bombs}}.
* Fixed [[Ultra Greed]] not having a door at the top of the room to spawn enemies from (it was always meant to be there).
* Fixed some classic bosses (such as [[Peep]], [[Bloat]], and [[Monstro]]) being unable to jump over obstacles, despite clearly achieving enough visual height to do so.
* Super Sins no longer appear in the first chapter.
* [[Mom]] and [[Satan]]'s legs now deal contact damage. Does not apply to disjointed legs, such as from High Priestess or [[Broken Shovel]].
* [[Fistula]] has been moved from the {{s|Cellar}} to the {{s|Caves}} (instead of {{s|Basement}}. (This is how it was in Wrath of the Lamb.)
* Restored a missing [[Blastocyst]] attack from the original game (the random arced shots when the largest form is jumping), and restored its original, larger shot size.
* The animations and behavior for [[Widow]] and [[The Wretched]] have been sped up to more closely resemble how it was in Wrath of the Lamb.
* Replaced [[Big Horn]]'s ability to summon [[Little Horn]] with a new combo attack, in which Big Horn temporarily brings Little Horn out to shoot three consecutive smoke balls.
* [[Big Horn]]'s black balls now bounce off of him when coming into contact instead of hurting him and destroying the balls.
* [[Conquest]] and the [[Isaac (Boss)|Isaac boss]] now use a delayed version of the {{i|Crack the Sky}} beam which leaves the player with enough time to move out of the way.
* Boss attacks that involve {{i|Crack the Sky}} beams are now more aggressive to compensate for the above change.
* [[Daddy Long Legs|Daddy Longlegs]] and [[Triachnid]] random stomp attacks are now distributed more evenly.
* [[Daddy Long Legs|Daddy Longlegs]] and [[Triachnid]] have had their health increased to 500 (from 300).
* Ultra Pride baby (Florian) health has been increased to 30 (from 25).
* Increased the health of minibosses by varying amounts (does not include Krampus, Envy, or Super Envy).
* [[Mega Satan]] now has boss armor (not as much as [[Hush]], don't worry).
* Made several adjustments to the [[Matriarch]]:
** Decreased [[Fistula]] pieces spawned when changing phases to 1 (from 2)
** Spawning [[Fistuloid]]s now consumes 30 HP, Fistuloids will not be spawned if this would cause a phase change (this does not apply to Fistuloid spam attack)
** Fistuloids will chase the player less aggressively and refrain from attacking while the Matriarch is doing her 8-way chubber attack

== Rooms ==
* Rooms with spikes directly next to the entrance have been adjusted. The spikes are either moved away from the door or blocked off.
* Adjusted the appearance rate of many special rooms to be more balanced (the black poop super secret room is now rarer, for example).
* Rooms with water in them now automatically extinguish fireplaces. Most Flooded Caves rooms have fireplaces pre-extinguished.
* Updated many existing room layouts and certain [[Greed Mode]] waves to make them more consistently fair.
* Certain floor alts now share fewer rooms/enemies with each other, in order to make them more distinct.
* Added new doors for dice rooms, chest rooms, sacrifice rooms, libraries, and shops. (They are also revealed on the minimap.)
* Added thousands of new room layouts.
* Fixed all off-grid rooms not being consistently seeded due to extra-special rooms spawning (such as sacrifice rooms or arcades).

== Special Rooms - Shop (2) ==
* [[Sacks]] can now be sold in shops for {{pennies|7}}.
* All items in the shop item pool are now completely decremented on sight (instead of being decremented by half).

== Special Rooms - Treasure (4) ==
* Removed Greed Gapers from treasure rooms.

== Special Rooms - Boss (5) ==
* Small boss rooms have been disabled.
* If pits are near the trap door that spawns after a boss, they will now be automatically filled and become walkable. This prevents situations where a trap door could block off devil/angel doors.

== Special Rooms - Miniboss (6) ==
* Small miniboss rooms have been disabled.

== Special Rooms - Secret (7) ==
* Fixed [[Secret Room]]s connected to the [[Treasure Room]] not having an exit when teleporting there in [[Greed Mode]].

== Special Rooms - Curse (10) ==
* Updated the hit detection of Curse Room doors to prevent situations where it may not damage players entering at high speeds.

== Special Rooms - Challenge (11) ==
* [[Challenge Room]] waves are now randomized, and each floor features unique waves (previously they were shared for every alt floor in a chapter).
* [[Challenge Room]] doors re-close if Isaac no longer meets their entry conditions while in the adjacent room.
* Boss [[Challenge Room]]s now always contain a boss pool item. Isaac must be at one heart or less total to enter, including soul/black hearts.

== Special Rooms - Devil (14) ==
* Fixed being able to survive fatal devil deals by holding certain actives over Isaac's head and leaving the room (such as {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}).
* [[Krampus]] can now only appear if the player has previously entered a devil deal.
* Devil deals now accept bone hearts, equal in worth to a regular heart container.
* Devil deal items cannot be purchased unless Isaac has the asking price.
* If Isaac only has one heart container, devil items that would normally cost two heart containers now cost one heart container plus two soul hearts.
* If Isaac has enough health of various types, the devil may randomly ask for three soul hearts or a mixture of one heart container plus two soul hearts.
* Some items now cost more in devil deals. These include {{i|Dark Bum}}, {{i|Dead Cat}}, {{i|Ceremonial Robes}}, and {{i|Succubus}}.

== Special Rooms - Angel (15) ==
* Angel deals can now be guaranteed if the first seen devil deal is skipped without entering it.

== Special Rooms - Crawlspace (16) ==
* Leaving a crawlspace from any unintended direction now teleports the player to the [[I AM ERROR]] room.

== UI ==
* The item tracker now includes a "mini" option, allowing for more items to be displayed at once.
* The tears stat on the HUD now displays as "tears per second" (previously displayed delay between tears in frames).
* The range stat on the HUD now displays the amount of effective range in tiles (this also fixes misleading cases like Mini Mush/Kidney Stone).
* Devil/angel chances on the HUD have changed to display the chance the respective deal will appear (previously displayed the chance for an angel deal to replace a devil deal).
* Duplicate items now show up on the item tracker/pause menu/game over screen.
* Smelted/gulped trinkets now show up on the item tracker.
* "Delete Save" confirmation dialog now defaults to "No" instead of "Yes".
* "goto" console command now accepts the prefix "x" for special rooms from the current stage.
* Composite enemies (such as Mr. Maw) now show up as a single entry in the Bestiary.
* Bloodstain from the character selection menu now uses multiply blending so it no longer obscures starting item names.
* Restored Blastocyst's intro animation from the original game.
* Updated the boss intros to have more depth and animation, similar to Wrath of the Lamb.
* Updated Bestiary animations for some enemies.
* Updated the stat marks on the pause screen to be more accurate.
* Updated the sorting and placement of character completion marks.
* Added new minimap icons for sacks, crawlspaces, runes, beggars, machines, and the dressing table.
* Added new icons for challenge destinations.
* Added narration voice lines for the cards that did not have them (Era Walk, Huge Growth, Ancient Recall).
* Added "heart flash" HUD effect when gaining hearts or healing (like it does in Wrath of the Lamb).
* Added new curse icons under the minimap.
* Added many missing enemy death portraits.
* Fixed game over screen displaying the wrong location name in [[Greed Mode]].
* Fixed Greedier mode becoming visible (but impossible to select) when switching languages.
* Fixed some enemy kills being counted in the bestiary multiple times per kill.
* Fixed win streaks not being cleared when exiting to the main menu as Isaac is dying.

== Graphics & Environment ==
* Brightness around players has been increased in order to aid visibility in [[Curses|Curse of Darkness]] on lower gamma settings.
* [[Dingle]] now shoots poop shots instead of blood shots (aside from the red champion), to be consistent with other poop enemies.
* Head costumes now deform along with the player's head when firing charged attacks, such as Brimstone.
* Light beams (such as {{i|Crack the Sky}} beams or the Cathedral's entrance beam) and many tear effects now properly light up dark rooms.
* Pin and its variants spawn less excessively large blood explosions on death.
* Updated sprites for various enemies, bosses, items, obstacles, characters, and more.
* Updated the [[Dank Depths]] backdrop and pits.
* Updated the [[Burning Basement]] and [[Cathedral]] to have light sources from the backdrop.
* Updated water from the [[Flooded Caves]] and [[Scarred Womb]] to have reflections.
* Updated the player teleport animation to respect the silhouette of certain characters.
* Updated many of the "giant book" animations (e.g. {{i|The Book of Belial}}, {{i|The Necronomicon}}).
* Updated all familiar animations to use interpolation.
* Added new visual effects for [[Utero]].
* Added minor color correction for various floors/special rooms.
* Added new death effects for the Steven boss.
* Added unique item costumes for [[Keeper]], [[Blue Baby]], [[Apollyon]], and [[Black Judas]].
* Added a new coloring system for champion enemies.
* Added dust particles on death for bone enemies.
* Added new attacking visual effects for many enemies, and new effects for enemies with stomp attacks (i.e. Monstro).
* Added visual effects for certain champions to make their effects more clear (most notably the Pulsing Red and Pulsing Dark Gray champions).
* Fixed crawlspace items suddenly having a pedestal underneath them when leaving and reentering the room.
* Fixed [[Hush]] entrance door skipping its animation when opened while having a golden key.
* Fixed a few animation issues with [[Rag Man]].
* Fixed barred doors playing their closing animation upon entering the room.
* Fixed boss shadows becoming invisible during their death animations.
* Fixed Spirit of the Night, Dead Dove, Empty Vessel, and Guppy not properly overwriting the front wings layer from other flight items.
* Fixed the fire animation on [[Flaming Gaper]]s and [[Flaming Fatty|Flaming Fatties]] playing too fast.
* Fixed the fire animation on [[Flaming Fatty|Flaming Fatties]] and [[Flaming Hopper]]s not playing when they are not moving.
* Fixed Pin's dirt segment briefly appearing as its head before exploding on death (this also applied to the Frail and Scolex).
* Fixed Isaac being able to die while the big chest opening animation is playing (did nothing aside from visual bugs with the animation).
* Fixed a regression to light blending which caused colors to appear more washed out compared to Rebirth.

== Sounds & Music ==
* [[Challenge Room]]s no longer interrupt the floor music theme pre-ambush.
* Minibosses now use the ambush theme instead of the regular boss theme.
* Floor music layers can now play if the room's enemies' total HP reaches a certain threshold (previously required a certain amount of enemies in a room to play the music layer).
* Restored [[Gurdy]]'s taunting laugh animation (after hitting the player) from the original game.
* Added new music tracks for [[Utero]], [[Super Secret Room]]s, [[Boss Rush]], and the credits (after [[Blue Baby]] has been unlocked).
* Added new sound effects for {{i|Brimstone}}, {{i|Glass Cannon}}, {{i|Technology}}, {{i|Tech X}}, {{i|Holy Mantle}}, {{i|Death's Touch}}, {{i|Crack the Sky}}, {{i|Clicker}}, {{i|The Book of Belial}}, {{i|Eye of Greed}}, [[Uriel]]/[[Gabriel]]'s wings and attacks, [[Stoney|Stonies]], coin pickups, special rock destruction, [[Arcade]] doors, [[Blood Donation Machine]]s, [[Challenge Room]] doors, enemy deaths, black heart loss, [[Globin]] regeneration, small/large explosions, menu scrolling, enemy spawning, and the pause menu.
* Fixed burn sound not being played when Isaac takes contact damage from fireplaces.
* Fixed some enemies missing sound effects (such as Super Sloth's spider throwing attack, Gurdy Jr's slide, Blastocyst splitting, etc).

== Achievements ==
* Updated the "Mr. Resetter!" achievement to unlock scared hearts. Half soul hearts are now tied to the "Everything is Terrible" achievement.

== Hard Mode ==
* Reduced the frequency of tinted rocks.
* Reduced the soul heart drop rate from blue/purple fireplaces to 10% (normal mode percentage is the usual 25%).
* Shops can randomly be lower level, even with upgrades unlocked for them.
* {{i|IV Bag}} now only pays out with one coin per use, to match the payout rate of blood donation machines in Hard mode.
* Added new "micro batteries" that restore 2 bars of charge.
* Shot speed for many classic enemies has been increased.
* Increased the charging speed of Horseman bosses.
* Does not prevent rooms marked as "lower difficulty" from spawning anymore, but makes them less likely to appear.
* [[Bomb Bum]]s and [[Key Master]]s no longer adhere to the 6 payment minimum of beggars in Hard mode, allowing payouts earlier than before.
* The reduction of heart drops has been changed to -33% (previously -65%), and bosses can drop hearts again.

== Misc ==
* Coop can now be played with multiple, separate characters instead of babies. If played with multiple characters, bosses will drop multiple items.
* [[Greed Mode]] and [[Greedier Mode]] now feature floor alts (Burning Basement, Necropolis, etc.).
* [[Curses|Curse of the Maze]] now avoids teleporting players to already explored rooms.
* Homing tears now target enemies much more reliably.
* It is now possible to see items again that have been rerolled away from by full run reroll effects (this should prevent "Breakfasting" with them).
* Pretty Flies are no longer counted as items for scoring purposes.
* Most weapons and tear effects now induce knockback on enemies and bombs. (e.g. {{i|Mom's Knife}}, {{i|Tech X}})
* Farts from both players and enemies can now push bombs and pickups.
* "Choice" pedestals (such as those found in [[Angel Room]]s or [[Boss Rush]]) now remember that they're supposed to be a choice when duplicated or moved out of the room.
* Fixed full run reroll effects not properly removing rerolled items from item history.
* Fixed several seeding issues with item pedestals which caused inconsistent rerolls in seeded runs.
* Fixed being able to go to the [[I AM ERROR]] room in [[The Void]].
* Fixed being able to access [[The Void]] after the first [[Hush]] kill in the save file by leaving and entering the room.
* Fixed a long-standing bug where tears and projectiles fired very close to a wall would instantly collide with it (this was an issue with splitting shots and enemies that explode into projectiles on death).
* Fixed being able to use teleportation cards and active items during a room transition, resulting in the teleport being wasted.
* Fixed certain items and rainbow poop being able to heal Isaac as he dies (while this had no effect, it was confusing to have hearts visible on the game over page).
* Red chests in the starting room of the [[Dark Room]] now turn into devil deals when opened. These must still be paid for.
* The shop on the first floor is now free to enter.
* Rate of fire can now be improved beyond the previous limit, allowing items such as Soy Milk to benefit from tears upgrades.
* Shot speed no longer has any impact on effective range.
* Time scaling effects have been reworked to affect enemy/player animation speed and attack rate, and no longer affect the range of tears.
* Bomb damage has been increased to 100 (from 60). Mega bombs (such as those from {{i|Mr. Mega}} or {{i|Mr. Boom}}) now deal 185 damage (from 110). Bombs now pierce enemy armor.
* Blue spider damage has been reduced to 2x Isaac's damage (previously x2.5).
* The [[Guppy]] transformation now grants a 50% chance to spawn a blue fly upon attacking enemies (previously 100%).
* The [[Stompy]] transformation now allows the player to crush rocks by walking over them.
* It is now possible to fully empty heart containers through donations or self-harm items.
* Double red hearts can now uncommonly drop randomly (previously they only appeared in specific room layouts, killing dark red champions, or with {{i|Humbleing Bundle}}). The spawn chance is 1/20 in Normal mode and 1/50 in Hard mode.
* [[Sacrifice Room]] spikes, [[Curse Room]] doors, spiked chests, {{i|Kamikaze!}}, {{i|Sharp Plug}}, and the Bad Trip pill no longer compromise devil/angel room chances if they damage red hearts. These sources also no longer count as damage for scoring purposes.
* Most forms of player creep now deal damage ticks at a significantly increased rate.
* Invincibility effects with contact damage (such as {{i|The Gamekid}}) now deal 20 damage every half-second (from 40 damage every full second, meaning potential DPS is unchanged but feels more responsive). If an enemy is at 40 HP or less, they will still be killed immediately on contact.
* Locusts of War (including the ones generated by 7 Seals) now have smaller explosions, which should result in less self-damage taken from them.
* Full run reroll effects (such as D4) are now able to remove heart containers and transformations if losing the respective items during the reroll. Rerolls also does not directly grant health, and heart containers gained from rerolling will start empty.
* Damage upgrades (and other tear size increases) don't increase tear size quite as much as before.

