* 149 - {{i|Ipecac}} - Now synergizes with {{i|Tech.5}} to make explosive lasers.
* 149 - {{i|Ipecac}} - Now synergizes with {{i|Mom's Knife}} to make the knife explode on contact.
* 172 - {{i|Sacrificial Dagger}} - Now ticks once every 8 frames (instead of once every 4 frames), which means that it effectively deals half as much damage.
