== Enemies ==
* [[Sub Horf]]s can now randomly replace [[Horf]]s.
* Certain bosses had an environment switch/addition/removal:
** [[Dingle]], [[Dangle]], [[Gemini]], [[Steven]], the [[Gurglings]] and the [[Turdlings]] can now additionally appear in the {{s|Burning Basement}}.
** [[The Haunt]] now only appears in the {{s|Cellar}}.
** [[Rag Man]] no longer appears in the {{s|Basement}}.
** [[Mega Fatty]] and [[Mega Maw]] can now additionally appear in the {{s|Flooded Caves}}.
** [[The Forsaken]] and [[The Frail]] no longer appear in the {{s|Caves}}.
** [[Polycephalus]] and [[Dark One]] now only appear in the {{s|Catacombs}}.
** [[The Stain]] no longer appears in the {{s|Catacombs}}.
** [[The Cage]] can now additionally appear in the {{s|Dank Depths}}.
** [[The Gate]] still appears in the {{s|Depths}}, but has been moved from {{s|Necropolis}} to the {{s|Dank Depths}}.
** [[The Adversary]] now only appears in {{s|Necropolis}}.
** [[Mama Gurdy]], [[Blastocyst]] and [[The Matriarch]] no longer appear in the {{s|Utero}}.
** [[Sisters Vis]] and [[Triachnid]] no longer appear in the {{s|Womb}}.
** [[Daddy Long Legs]] and [[Teratoma]] now only appear in the {{s|Utero}}.
** [[Lokii]] can now additionally appear in the {{s|Scarred Womb}}.
** [[Mr. Fred]] still appears in the {{s|Womb}}, but has been moved from the {{s|Utero}} to the {{s|Scarred Womb}}.
** [[The Bloat]] now only appears in the {{s|Utero}} in [[Chapter 4]].
* You can no longer kill [[??? (Boss)|???]] and [[Hush]] with a single [[Chaos Card]] by throwing it from the bottom.
* [[Tar Boy]]s will no longer come up underneath where you are standing, dealing unavoidable damage.
* [[Host]]s are now immune to fear. (This prevents them from attacking.)
* [[The Adversary]] no longer destroys blue fires when he does his shockwave attack.

== Other ==
* The rock replacement mechanic in Afterbirth+ alternate floors is removed.
* All items that granted tear delay down no longer do so. Instead, they give the normal tear stat, but allow breaks of the 5.0 cap at a rate commensurate with how much tear delay down that they used to give.
* The tears up system has changed. For example, it now takes 3x {{i|The Sad Onion}} to max the player's tear rate (instead of 2x).
* The stat HUD from Afterbirth+ (i.e. the "Found HUD") has been replaced with the Antibirth implementation, which has different graphics and functions slightly differently.
* [[Bone heart]]s now have priority over [[soul heart]]s and [[black heart]]s when your health is full.
* You can no longer donate twice to [[Devil Beggar]]s using invincibility frames.
* Crawlspaces will now spawn closed if the room is uncleared. (Boss Rush and Challenge Rooms are exempt from this behavior.)
* [[Tears]] are now properly circular instead of slightly polygonal.
* Items now cast shadows on item pedestals (like it is in Wrath of the Lamb).
* You can now use the Home and End keys in the console.

== Bug Fixes ==
* Fixed the bug where if you switched to [[The Soul]] on the same frame that you accumulated a {{i|Dead Eye}} charge, the game would crash.
* Fixed the bug where Vivid Orange (#3) champions would spawn multiple coins on the same position.
* Fixed the bug where [[Pin]] did not have a champion entity added. It is now a black champion with custom tear effects. ([[Scolex]] now has the bugged champion removed.)
* Fixed the bug where pickups rolled with the {{i|D20}} were unseeded.
* Fixed the bug where using a [[Strength]] card on [[Keeper]] while at one coin container would permanently grant a second coin container.
* Fixed the bug where the player would not die when at 0 health under certain conditions (e.g. [[Keeper]] using {{i|Guppy's Paw}}, using {{i|The Candle}} while taking a devil deal).
* Fixed the bug where [[Batteries#Lil' Battery|Lil' Batteries]] would charge {{i|Eden's Soul}} for 12 charges instead of 6.
* Fixed the bug where [[Batteries#Lil' Battery|Lil' Batteries]] would charge Mega Blast for 3 charges instead of 6.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Cursed Eye}} would not work property with {{i|Incubus}}.
* Fixed the bug where [[Reward Plate]]s that spawned two different pickups would spawn them at the exact same position.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Clicker}} could randomly choose the same character that you already were.
* Fixed the bug where stat downs were applied after stat ups. (For example, this would result in speed is capped at 1.8 instead of 2.0 if you had {{i|The Small Rock}}.)
* Fixed the bug where {{t|Daemon's Tail}} did not have an outline.
* Fixed the bug where the stacked [[Vis]] entities were bugged in Miniboss room #2112.
* Fixed the bug where [[The Lamb]] could perform a spinning brimstone attack when standing next to a wall and cause unavoidable damage.
* Fixed the bug where [[The Lamb]] could move while a Brimstone attack was still ongoing.
* Fixed the bug where you could softlock in Depths/Necropolis/Dank room #39 when the random bomb drops spawned as troll bombs.
* Fixed the bug where you could softlock in Depths/Necropolis/Dank room #39 when entering from the left side with only one bomb.
* Fixed the bug where Keeper could revive with a half soul heart instead of a coin container under certain conditions.
* Fixed the bug where reseeding a floor (with e.g. {{i|Forget Me Now}}, 5-pip [[Dice Room]]) would incorrectly randomize the rooms because it used the same xorshift constants in the <code>ForgetStageSeed</code> function.
* Fixed the bug where killing an enemy in the <code>PostEntityKill</code> callback would cause a buffer overflow and crash the game.
* Fixed the bug where small chests will revert to normal size if you exit the room and re-enter.
* Fixed the bug where using {{i|Sacrificial Altar}} did not properly remove {{i|Lil Delirium}}.
* Fixed the bug where <code>[INFO] - Failed to load image</code> would be logged every time you entered a crawlspace.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Divorce Papers}} spawns {{t|Mysterious Paper}} but does not actually remove Mysterious Paper from the trinket pool.
* Fixed the bug where if you were fighting two angels at the same time, the first one killed would not drop a key piece.
* Fixed the bug where rerolling your build would not cause the active item inside of a {{i|Schoolbag}} to drop on the ground.
* Fixed the bug where Isaac's split tear attack on phase 2 would be different depending on your range stat.
* Fixed the bug where Large (#19) and Skull (#23) champions would deal contact damage to the player even if the non-champion version of the enemy was not supposed to deal contact damage.
* Fixed the bug where mods were not able to modify the "seeds.txt" file.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Dad's Ring}} would not display correctly with {{i|Holy Mantle}}.
* Fixed the bug with [[Cage]] where he would generate creep during his slam attack before he actually landed.
* Fixed the bug where using {{i|Delirious}} to spawn [[Gemini]] would make chains persist on the screen forever under certain conditions (e.g. immediately exiting the room).
* Fixed the bug where [[Gurglings]] erroneously appeared twice in the boss table for {{i|Delirious}}.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Delirious}} would spawn an extra, untextured [[Lokii]].
* Fixed the bug where if you happened to randomly get the {{i|Breath of Life}} effect from a {{i|Metronome}}, then it would slowly kill you with no way to stop it.
* Fixed the bug where all forms of teleportation were not properly seeded per floor. For example, now, the first time you use {{i|Teleport!}}, it will always take you to the same room no matter which room you were already in.
* Fixed the bug where The Shop room #238 in [[Greed Mode]] had all of the doors disabled. (This is room #57 in Repentance.)
* Fixed the bug where [[Mom#Champion Versions|Blue Champion Mom]] would not make the proper sound when spawning monsters.

== New Features ==
* True online multiplayer was added with the new <code>netstart</code> console command. It was not announced officially because it is in early development and still has bugs. More information can be found on the [[Debug Console]] page.

